WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:09.950
Two years, four months and 15 days ago, Great Big&nbsp;Story closed its doors.

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:12.795
But the world is still full of stories...

00:00:12.795 --> 00:00:16.531
Stories of adventure, adrenaline&nbsp;and exhilaration.

00:00:16.764 --> 00:00:22.559
Human stories about endurance, creativity, culture and cuisine.

00:00:23.266 --> 00:00:26.099
There are lots&nbsp;of stories about cuisine...

00:00:26.099 --> 00:00:26.892
Food

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:27.392
Drink

00:00:27.392 --> 00:00:28.115
Cooking

00:00:28.157 --> 00:00:29.117
Tradition...

00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:32.553
It captures our hearts and sparks our&nbsp;imagination.

00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:34.704
And so does the world around us.

00:00:34.803 --> 00:00:36.994
Its monumental landscapes

00:00:36.994 --> 00:00:38.223
hidden wonders

00:00:38.223 --> 00:00:40.663
and the&nbsp;awe-inspiring wildlife we share our planet with.

00:00:43.746 --> 00:00:44.923
Stories about Science

00:00:45.314 --> 00:00:46.433
Technology

00:00:46.542 --> 00:00:48.171
Innovation

00:00:48.246 --> 00:00:49.295
and inspiration.

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.190
Stories that change the way that we see the world.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.906
This is Great Big Story.

00:01:00.635 --> 00:01:02.169
And there's more to come...

